    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is syd \u00fea land gemere to alresforda. Erest up of cendefer andlang mearce on \u00fea witan dic. \u00de andlang dic on mearc weg andland weges on \u00feer dene. On \u00feer dene on smalandene, of smalandene andlang hlinces on bucgen oran. \u00de ford andlang wyrtwale on \u00fea rode, andlang rode on wilames ord. \u00deonon on spreot mere \u00feonon on \u00feo twibutme del. \u00deonon on beran delle, on mint mere. Of mint mere on fel dene, \u00feonne andlang fel dene on \u00feone hagan. \u00deonne andlang hagan on grem meres sy\u00f0le. \u00deonon andlang hagan on bocmeres sy\u00f0le. Of bocmeres shi\u00f0le on hamer dene gat. \u00deonne non on hrombmescumbes geat, of hramnescumbes geate on dun shihle. Of dun shihle andlang mearce ut at ricgsceate. \u00de andlang mearce to dregtune on \u00feane ford. Of \u00f0an forda on wuda ford \u00fe up of \u00fean forda andlang mearce on \u00feane garan uf wer\u00f0ne. Of \u00fean garan nord ofer \u00feast ret. Andlang mearce on \u00fea \u00e6wylmas andlang wylla on ticceburnan \u00feonne andlang streames on iccenan. Andlang icenan on \u00feer cendefer ut scyt. \u00deonne up andlang cendefer o\u00f0 \u00fear hit on feng..",
